# Phase 1 ACL. The broker derives `username` from the TLS client cert CN
# (use_identity_as_username true), and `%u` below substitutes that CN.
#
# Devices: CN = device UUID. Each device is locked to dev/<its-uuid>/#.
# Ingest worker: CN = "ingest". Reads everything under dev/+/, writes only
#   commands to dev/+/cmd/+.
# Bootstrap (provisioning) certs are NOT permitted by this Phase 1 ACL;
# provisioning lands in task 08 with its own narrow rule.

# --- per-device subtree -----------------------------------------------------
# %u expands to the cert CN. Devices may publish telemetry/health/event
# announcements and subscribe to their command channel and last-will.
pattern readwrite dev/%u/#

# --- ingest worker ----------------------------------------------------------
user ingest
topic read  dev/+/tlm
topic read  dev/+/spect
topic read  dev/+/health
topic read  dev/+/event/announce
topic read  dev/+/event/done
topic read  dev/+/lwt
topic write dev/+/cmd/+
